    "Credentials go on the APIs page: a \"Telnyx\" entry with its API key, or a \"Twilio\" entry with the account SID as client key and the auth token as API key. Leave blank to turn telephony off.": "Las datas d'access van sin la pagina da las APIs: ina endataziun \"Telnyx\" cun sia clav API, u ina endataziun \"Twilio\" cun il SID dal conto sco clav dal client ed il token d'autentificaziun sco clav API. Laschar vid per deactivar la telefonia.",
    "From number": "Numer dal speditur",
    "Your number at the provider, in E.164 form: the setup button verifies it as caller ID, and inbound calls to it are answered by the agent below.": "Tes numer tar il purschider en il format E.164: il buttun da configuraziun al verifitgescha sco ID dal clamader, e l'agent sutvart respunda ils cloms entrants sin quest numer.",
