    "OpenAI project ID": "ID dal project OpenAI",
    "Calls are bridged to sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.": "Ils cloms vegnan colliads cun sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.",
    "Allowed countries": "Pajais permess",
    "Countries calls may be placed to, as comma-separated ISO codes such as GB, US. Applied to the selected provider when changed, and by its setup button.": "Pajais nua ch'ins po telefonar, sco codes ISO separads cun commas, p.ex. GB, US. Vegn applitgà al purschider tschernì tar ina midada e cun ses buttun da configuraziun.",
    "Telnyx connection ID": "ID da la colliaziun Telnyx",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "L'applicaziun da vusch da Telnyx tras la quala ils cloms vegnan fatgs. \"Configurar Telnyx\" la crea per tai; sia URL dal webhook vegn tegnida actuala automaticamain.",
    "Set up Telnyx": "Configurar Telnyx",
    "Creates the voice application and outbound profile through the Telnyx API, then verifies the From number as caller ID by SMS code.": "Crea l'applicaziun da vusch ed il profil sortent tras l'API da Telnyx e verifitgescha lura il numer dal speditur sco ID dal clamader cun in code SMS.",
    "Set up Twilio": "Configurar Twilio",
    "Enables the allowed countries and points the From number at the webhook through the Twilio API, then verifies the From number as caller ID with a call from Twilio if the account does not own it.": "Activescha ils pajais permess e drizza il numer dal speditur sin il webhook tras l'API da Twilio, verifitgescha lura il numer dal speditur sco ID dal clamader cun in clom da Twilio sch'il conto n'al possede betg.",
    "Public URL": "URL publica",
